    <p>Creating project abstract Features to be covered: Formatting Style, Inserting tablr, Bullets and Numbering, Changing Text Direction, Cell alignment, Footnote, Hyperlink, Symbols, Spell Check, Track Changes</p>
    <p>Creating a Newsletter: Feature to be coverd: table of Content, Newspaper columns, Images from files and clipart, Drawing toolbar and Word Art, Formatting Images, Textboxes, Paragraphs and Mail Merge in Word</p>
